令 $\mathcal R=\operatorname{span}_{j\ge0}T^jU$、$h=\dim\mathcal R$。该节的满行秩可达块及商算子论证对每个有限参数给

$$
f([e_0+\lambda e_1])-1
=\dim\ker(\bar T-\lambda I),
